/**
 * Controllers handle HTTP request/response cycle.
 * Controllers call Service methods for business logic.
 * 
 * Convention:
 *   - One controller file per resource (e.g., auth.controller.ts)
 *   - Controllers do NOT contain business logic
 *   - Controllers validate input using Zod validators
 *   - Controllers return standardized JSON responses
 */

